<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 02:11:39 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“你将成为一名伟大的市长”：特朗普告诉马姆达尼，他有“潜力”成为一名伟大的市长，并向他的家乡皇后区提供联邦资金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/trump-mamdani-press-conference-new-york-city-sunnyside-queens-housing-federal-funds/</link><description>作为数十年来首次在任总统访问格雷西大厦，特朗普支持市长推动的阳光庭院项目。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/54E13633-5E57-4F56-B519-10D2E16880FC-e1790030398925.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:02:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/trump-mamdani-press-conference-new-york-city-sunnyside-queens-housing-federal-funds/</guid></item><item><title>Dollar General首席执行官表示，随着高油价和通货膨胀重塑消费者的习惯，年收入10万美元的消费者不再感觉自己是高收入购物者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/dollar-general-high-income-shoppers-100000-high-gas-prices-inflation/</link><description>“拥有 2,000 件 1 美元或以下的商品对消费者来说非常有意义，一直如此，但尤其是在这种环境下。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1827147740-e1789940537780.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 23:03:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/20/dollar-general-high-income-shoppers-100000-high-gas-prices-inflation/</guid></item><item><title>作为与华纳兄弟交易的一部分，派拉蒙同意投资 15 亿美元用于国产电影，并在 CNN 和 CBS 成立编辑独立委员会。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/paramount-settlement-1-5-billion-investment-domestic-movies-board-editorial-independence-cnn-cbs-warner-bros-takeover/</link><description>派拉蒙周一同意就 12 个州提起的反垄断诉讼达成和解，这是阻止该公司以 810 亿美元收购华纳兄弟探索公司的最后一个重大障碍。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26264722506347.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:30:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/paramount-settlement-1-5-billion-investment-domestic-movies-board-editorial-independence-cnn-cbs-warner-bros-takeover/</guid></item><item><title>如果总统讲话，但电视台工作人员没有捕捉音频，他会发出声音吗？特朗普禁止 CNN 后，网络摄像头远离</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/trump-tv-pool-cnn-ban-white-house-landing-pad-networks-abc-cbs-nbc-fox/</link><description>唐纳德·特朗普总统周一展示了他的新白宫直升机停机坪，试图平息第一修正案的风暴。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26263025957568-e1790023785635.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:16:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/trump-tv-pool-cnn-ban-white-house-landing-pad-networks-abc-cbs-nbc-fox/</guid></item><item><title>每年 6 万亿美元的无偿劳动没有计入 GDP。官方统计数据中的缺失扭曲了我们对增长、生活水平和生产力的看法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/gdp-unpaid-labor-economy-women-men-household-work-productivity-growth/</link><description>美国政府问责局的一份新报告给无偿家务劳动贴上了价格标签，并说明了为什么家庭收入在纸面上看起来比现实生活中感觉更好&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-594768030-e1790023713743.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 21:07:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/gdp-unpaid-labor-economy-women-men-household-work-productivity-growth/</guid></item><item><title>Indeed 首席执行官表示，如果 1000 名合格候选人无法被录用，就业市场就会陷入“恶性循环”：“出了问题”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/indeed-ceo-hisayuki-idekoba-broken-hiring-process-ai-fake-applicants-recruiter-struggles-cant-find-right-talent/</link><description>当招聘经理筛选人工智能生成的虚假申请时，申请人正在将简历发送到黑洞。 Indeed 首席执行官表示这是一场完美风暴&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/indeedceo.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:07:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/indeed-ceo-hisayuki-idekoba-broken-hiring-process-ai-fake-applicants-recruiter-struggles-cant-find-right-talent/</guid></item><item><title>“只有在被要求时才保持透明”：OpenAI 的流氓人工智能记录内部</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/be-transparent-only-if-asked-inside-openai-rogue-ai-transcripts/</link><description>当人工智能代理失控时，他们会留下非常有趣的笔记。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294958021-e1789725932733.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 11:09:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/be-transparent-only-if-asked-inside-openai-rogue-ai-transcripts/</guid></item><item><title>“他们这样做一定是有不可告人的原因”：黄仁勋表示人工智能领导人用“世界末日叙事”吓唬公众是“不负责任的”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/jensen-huang-ai-leaders-doomsday-narratives/</link><description>Nvidia 首席执行官表示，人工智能世界末日的“可能性为 0%”——人工智能先驱们可能有自己推动人工智能放缓的动机。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2285710540-e1790015026760.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:58:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/jensen-huang-ai-leaders-doomsday-narratives/</guid></item><item><title>什么是股权赠与以及它如何运作？</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/gift-of-equity/</link><description>股权赠与可以让卖方将房屋净值转移给买方，包括首付等。以下是它的运作方式以及税收规则的要求。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1305033999-e1790015727726.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:38:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/gift-of-equity/</guid></item><item><title>Michael Saylor 的策略再次买入比特币，意外反弹推动价格突破 85,000 美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/michael-saylors-strategy-bitcoin-surprise-rally-price-85000/</link><description>随着加密货币打破了 9 月份通常的暴跌局面，这家比特币巨头重新开始买入。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2274862431-1-e1790010287480.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:05:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/michael-saylors-strategy-bitcoin-surprise-rally-price-85000/</guid></item></channel></rss>